1. First job in a sales talk?
2. When should you decline?
3. Why follow up?

## Check your work

1. Listen / understand the need
2. When you cannot deliver well or it is unsafe/unethical
3. Service quality and referrals

## Stretch

Role-play a 3-minute discovery conversation with a family member.

## Wrap-up

Summarize today''s lesson in 4–6 sentences. Then complete the graded check below before the lesson can be marked complete.','• Questions uncover needs.
