INSERT INTO "Lesson" VALUES('cmuh9byb309lxedanr9yl0faq','cmuh9byaw09l3edaniqwloo61','Highlight & Recruiting Literacy','Understand what coaches look for in film and communication — without hype or scams.','Welcome to **College Athletic Pathway** at Prosper Preparatory (Grade 10).

