INSERT INTO "Lesson" VALUES('cmuh9bz710d5bedank0yiql5y','cmuh9bz6h0d2xedanaoeawuya','Nutrition, Injury Awareness & Recovery Habits','Support performance with basic health literacy (not medical advice).','Welcome to **College Athletic Pathway** at Prosper Preparatory (Grade 12).

Today''s lesson: **Nutrition, Injury Awareness & Recovery Habits**. Support performance with basic health literacy (not medical advice).

Prosper Prep prepares students for **college athletic opportunities** and for **entrepreneurial / financial independence** after high school — whether or not they attend college.

## Learning goals
- Fuel training with regular meals and hydration habits.
- Report injuries honestly; playing through serious pain can worsen outcomes.
- This is general education — see qualified professionals for medical care.

## Teach

### Teaching point 1

Ask who / what / when / where / why. Geography and resources shape settlement, conflict, and culture.

### Teaching point 2

Sources have authors, audiences, and purposes. Sourcing and corroboration reduce being misled by a single account.

### Teaching point 3

Civic ideas (rights, responsibilities, constitutions, markets) connect past events to present participation.

### Concept 1

Fuel training with regular meals and hydration habits.

