INSERT INTO "Question" VALUES('cmuh9bwta03p6edanzuldwwi5',NULL,'cmuh9bwt703osedankdnrz7z1','MULTIPLE_CHOICE','[Author''s Purpose and Tone] When working on “Author''s Purpose and Tone,” which understanding should guide your first steps?','["Use an answer that fits a different lesson title entirely.","Purpose is why the author wrote: to inform, persuade, entertain, or a blend. Tone is the author''s attitude toward the subject (urgent, sarc…","Diction, imagery, and organization are clues. Loaded words signal persuasion; neutral definitions and data often signal…","Reverse the relationship taught in the worked example."]',1,'From the teach section: Purpose is why the author wrote: to inform, persuade, entertain, or a blend. Tone is the author''s attitude toward the subject (urgent, sarcastic, respectful, alarmed).',1,7);
